  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Spectators name him the young Gu Master who took second place at Five Virtues Sect and push a duel with Fang Yuan, the first-place demonic cultivator.",
      "chapters": [
        832
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master",
        "fac_five_virtues_sect",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a young face with bright, clear eyes.",
      "chapters": [
        834
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After his careful Gu fire explodes, that clean face is covered in soot until he looks like charcoal.",
      "chapters": [
        835
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recalls that hundreds of years later on Central Continent’s east coast a super force called Shan Chuan Hall is founded by Zheng Shan Chuan, skilled in refinement path. In the present, Fang Yuan judges that the youth who reached second place at Five Virtues Sect already has master-level refinement path attainment. Memory also holds that Old Man Qi Shan was secretly poisoned and that Zheng Shan Chuan tried every way to heal his master, with green shine Gu among the best healing Gu for that need.",
      "chapters": [
        833
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "prior-life-hall-founder",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "fac_shan_chuan_hall",
        "char_old_man_qi_shan",
        "sys_healing_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against his master’s wishes he insists on posing the problem in the duel because Fang Yuan lets him choose. Old Man Qi Shan then supports him and hands over careful Gu, the sole secret inheritance recipe not circulated outside. Zheng Shan Chuan hesitates at winning unfairly, then accepts because his master’s safety is at stake, gives Fang Yuan the recipe, and begins the duel.",
      "chapters": [
        834
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "careful-gu-duel",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Near the last steps he is confident of winning green shine Gu, then Fang Yuan laughs, names a refinement path killer move, and squashes the Gu. Zheng Shan Chuan screams that Fang Yuan destroyed green shine Gu, his fire explodes, and he freezes covered in soot. He kneels in tears beside Old Man Qi Shan afterward.",
      "chapters": [
        835
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "defeat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
